                        "review": "I was really hoping this would be just like \"The Banner Saga,\" unfortunately, it falls flat. \nThe combat frequently pits the player against unreasonable odds, and just isn't fun. \nThe story is all over the place.\nThe characters were mostly unlikable. \nAnd lastly, but most importantly, players were punished for decisions unfairly. Unlike other games in this genre (like Banner Saga) this game would throw in last minute surprises in a way that just felt like you were being punished to stimulate 'consequences\" even though the root cause of that problem was minuscule, and there was no emphasis on it being a big decision. \n",
